<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-AUSTRIA BEAT CROATIA 3-2 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRIA BEAT CROATIA 3-2 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>GRAZ, Austria 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria beat Croatia 3-2</p>
<p>in their European/African group one Davis Cup tie on Sunday.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat Thomas Muster (Austria) 6-7</p>
<p>(5-7) 7-5 6-7 (5-7) 6-2 7-5</p>
<p>Gilbert Schaller (Austria) beat Sasa Hirszon (Croatia) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>7-5</p>
</text>
